              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yesuwa, Bani, Kadmiel, Sebania, Buni, Serebia, Bani gi Kenan jocungo i wi kituti pa Jolevi aka joywak gi dwondi gin malo ri Rwoth Were pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
